OK, Paul, you must have been in the castle for this to happen. 
You can avoid falling in a trap door by:

	flying or levitating
	pushing a boulder ahead of you to plug the hole
	zapping a wand of secret door detection
	casting a spell of detect unseen
	memorizing where all the traps in the castle are in explore mode
	watching other non-flying creatures find them first
	writing Brandon Tartikoff, NBC, 30 Rockefeller Plaza, NYC 10112 
	    and asking them not to cancel Quantum Leap (Wed. 10PM)
	wearing a ring of searching

The last couple methods are not 100% effective, but may help.

